OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder over death
OL,4,Aof mother
OL,5,
OL,6,FA son has appeared in court accused of
OL,7,Fmurdering his mother.
OL,9,FJames Richardson, 39, appeared at
OL,10,FTaunton Magistrates' Court earlier
OL,11,Fcharged with the murder of Janet
OL,12,FRichardson.
OL,14,FMrs Richardson sustained significant
OL,15,Finjuries during an alleged incident at
OL,16,Fher home in Yatton, North Somerset, in
OL,17,FApril 2021. She died in January 2024 at
OL,18,Fthe age of 72.
